{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act26side_level_act26side_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act26side",
  "stageId": "act26side_04",
  "title": "我曾舍命为你",
  "storyCode": "HE-4",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2ad30dbb05f60f3c012dd666077fa3591b1d44cb95261f4c0501d4121c6a98ef",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥卢斯",
      "text": "我有一点惊讶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "因为我终究背叛了信仰吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥卢斯",
      "text": "是因为你的逃避，斯特凡诺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥卢斯",
      "text": "我不知道你是否是受到了什么外物的影响，如果......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "没有如果，奥卢斯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "我还不至于受源石技艺影响。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥卢斯",
      "text": "有时转变我们想法的并不一定是源石技艺。有太多东西足以影响我们，斯特凡诺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "......你在劝我重新考虑。为什么，异教的教士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "如今我的决定，难道不是你想要看到的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥卢斯",
      "text": "我不能否认。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥卢斯",
      "text": "但我也得承认，在这座了不起的建筑尚在伊比利亚时，我曾有幸在此学习，那段时光对于那时的我来说弥足珍贵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥卢斯",
      "text": "斯特凡诺，在这方面我同你一样。我对这里同样怀有感情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥卢斯",
      "text": "我还记得那位和你一起从拉特兰来的修士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥卢斯",
      "text": "我记得许多人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "你记得的那个人，在六十年前带上他的铳，决定和当时的国教会共进退，而我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "而我选择留下，保护剩下的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥卢斯",
      "text": "你以此为信念，坚持至今。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "既然你清楚，你仍要我继续等待，继续忍耐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "难道你现在要否认你一直宣扬的那些，转而要我斟酌，劝我坚定？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥卢斯",
      "text": "当然不。斯特凡诺，当然不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥卢斯",
      "text": "只是，正因我行走在我认为正确的路上，便希望你也如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥卢斯",
      "text": "明天早上，如果你仍然坚持，那么我便认为这就是你的选择。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥卢斯",
      "text": "我会准备好你需要的东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥卢斯",
      "text": "如果你还没有想好，我会劝你继续考虑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥卢斯",
      "text": "不论如何......我希望你的决定发自真心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "......奥卢斯，你弄错了一件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥卢斯",
      "text": "什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "text": "我已别无选择。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥卢斯",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥卢斯",
      "text": "好吧，如果真是如此......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥卢斯",
      "text": "那么我会欢迎你，斯特凡诺，我新的同胞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "介意我进来吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "......请进。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "打扰了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "你看起来不太好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "......我可以问一个问题吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "当然可以。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "......菲娜她，是不是已经......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "已经不在了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "......如果可以的话，我比较希望你能换一个问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "我不太想骗你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "其实我最开始就有这样的感觉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "那个时候，我忽然就、就感受不到菲娜......明明她那时那么生气，又那么难过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "她就在我面前啊......？我却哪里都找不到她......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "如果当时，我没帮你修那把铳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "别说了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "......别说了，求你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "text": "......好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "......我头顶的角，我摸到了。和莱蒙德他们一样的角。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "虽然再也没法握着铳祈祷，但至少现在......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "我终于，和莱蒙德，和卡洛琳姐......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福尔图娜",
      "text": "我终于和大家都一样了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "哈，去年还没这么早开花，今年怎么就这么巧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "也好，好歹算是最后开了一回。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "这样一来......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱蒙德",
      "text": "这样就没问题了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "你刚刚说......有萨科塔堕天？那个女孩叫福尔图娜？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "竟然出了这样的事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "堕天......只能回去后由教宗阁下定夺，不是现在我们能够处理的问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "但闯入我房间的那位不速之客不同。费德里科，有些事我之后再和你解释......现在必须要尽快把那家伙找出来才行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "我需要你的协助，执行者费德里科。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "它的机动性不弱，我虽然勉强追到这里，但还是追丢了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "咦，你居然没有立刻回复？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "很少见哦，你这样子我会觉得是出了什么大事......欸，你皱眉了，所以真的出了什么大事吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "......有琴声。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "琴声？有......吗？我好像没有听到......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "据我推断，琴声是从顶层圣堂的方向传来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "这样吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "老实说呢，这段时间以来我对你在公证所的工作多少有所了解，因此我会比较信任你的判断。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "现在我正式地询问你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "中庭公证所执行者费德里科，你真的认为这段来源不明，不确定影响，甚至有可能全然无害的琴声——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "会比我向你提出的协助请求更加重要吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "不会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "显而易见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "琴声的出现是偶然事件，我对此有所怀疑，但不可否认的是，暂时找不到其与目前发生的所有事件之间的直接关联。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "根据目前的形势判断，应优先执行协助任务，与你共同行动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "呵呵，不继续说下去了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "好啦，我可没有要欺负人的意思。只不过，我也确实需要确认一下你的态度......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "现在我明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "给我指一个方向，我继续追踪目标，琴声的事就交给你来解决。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "......本次任务需要优先确保你和奥伦的安全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "尽职尽责是好事，但是我觉得优先度这种东西，是要自己判断的哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "我感受不到你的情绪，费德里科。不过，我有一个黎博利朋友，因为无法和她共感，所以我早早学会了如何猜测他人的想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "虽然她比你好懂很多，但有些东西是共通的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "一个小小的忠告——或许有的时候，你得学会相信你的直觉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "就这么定了，我们没有多少时间可以浪费......我也得强迫自己活动一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾缪安",
      "text": "出发，大家行动起来~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "加快速度。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "费德里科先生！请、请等一下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "上面到底......到底有什么？只是琴声而已，而且现在已经听不到了啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "我们、我们真的就让那位小姐一个人去冒险吗？她还坐着轮椅......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "不用担心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "怎么可能不担心？我刚刚看到了......那是个怪物！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "蕾缪安由第七厅枢机亲自邀请加入教皇厅，实力不容小觑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "不要小看她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "我不太明白这些，也就是说，那位小姐也是很厉害的人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克莱芒",
      "text": "可是......万一呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "加快速度。或者留在原地等待。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "建议你选择后者。这是更安全的选择。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "（没有人？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "（不对。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "细微的声响在空旷的圣堂内荡开，铳上膛的声音与其同步响起。\n执行者猛然举起铳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "我只会再警告一次。从那里出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活泼的孩子",
      "text": "啊......被找到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "害羞的孩子",
      "text": "被找到了。和姐姐说的一样呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活泼的孩子",
      "text": "嗯，大哥哥一下就找到我们了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "害羞的孩子",
      "text": "真的、真的是姐姐说的那个大哥哥吗......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活泼的孩子",
      "text": "翅膀和圈圈都黑黑的，应该没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活泼的孩子",
      "text": "大哥哥，我的名字叫作艾伦戴尔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "害羞的孩子",
      "text": "我叫艾丝塔拉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "和你们提到我的人在哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丝塔拉",
      "text": "大哥哥，看起来好凶......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾伦戴尔",
      "text": "好凶哦！而且大哥哥都不说自己的名字......没有礼貌！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丝塔拉",
      "text": "妈妈说过，不可以回答不知道名字的陌生人的问题......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "费德里科。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丝塔拉",
      "text": "凶凶的费德里科哥哥，是好人吗......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾伦戴尔",
      "text": "肯定是好人！就像故事里说的那样~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丝塔拉",
      "text": "那、那可以说了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾伦戴尔",
      "text": "可以了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丝塔拉",
      "text": "嗯......那......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丝塔拉",
      "text": "有人告诉我们......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾伦戴尔",
      "text": "让我们在这里等一个凶巴巴的，和她一样头顶有黑色圈圈的大哥哥！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丝塔拉",
      "text": "还说、还说大哥哥会带我们找到妈妈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾伦戴尔",
      "text": "对啦！姐姐还说，我们只能等一小会，就一会会！如果大哥哥不来的话，我们就要自己跑出去~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丝塔拉",
      "text": "嗯......姐姐说不能一直待在这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丝塔拉",
      "text": "还说、还说......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丝塔拉&艾伦戴尔",
      "text": "呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丝塔拉&艾伦戴尔",
      "text": "大哥哥，大哥哥！快看......着火了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丝塔拉",
      "text": "哇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾伦戴尔",
      "text": "哇哇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "先出去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "text": "捂住口鼻，这里起火了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
